  "notes": "Geometry and textures only: no collision proxies, joints, springs or clip-on behaviour are modelled. TS35 x 7.5 x 250 rail, 1 mm stock, true through slots; eight generic IMC Controls screw terminals with wire tunnels, brass clamps, recessed slotted screws, fixed under-flange hooks and sliding latch feet; one end cover and one screw end clamp. Slots are exactly 25 x 5.3 at 25 mm longitudinal pitch, alternately offset +/-1 mm laterally. Equal-length, collinear slots at that pitch would touch and create nonmanifold web edges; the stagger is the closest faithful way to retain both dimensions and pitch. The terminals share a single baked atlas and retain distinct meshes. Metres, Z up, front -X, bottom-centre origin, applied transforms and a shared prop frame. Triangulated visual OBJ with normals, 30-degree smoothing, nonoverlapping 66-degree Smart UVs. Albedo: CPU Cycles 64-sample DIFFUSE COLOR * (0.4 + 0.6 * AO), RGB8 sRGB, no direct light or highlights. Full Principled PBR and marking images packed in source.blend. Preview: 1024 square, CPU Cycles 64, neutral grey, three lights, front-left above. Collision coordinates retain 12 decimal places in metres. Simulation may vary instance colour by 0.97-1.03. Suggested worktable position [0.400, 0, 0.800] m; positioning and reachable grasp poses are left to the scene, not baked into these local meshes.  Task 13 compact OBJ exception: positions use 5 decimal metres where safe; necessary vertices retain up to 6 decimals to preserve nonzero triangles, strict collision convexity and the 0.005 mm Euclidean movement bound. Independent fixed-5 rounding cannot satisfy all three. Normals/UVs use 4 decimals; every original triangle, position index and per-corner attribute value is retained. Equal rounded UV records share indices and visual OBJ indices use shorter equivalent relative notation. No collision remeshing, reindexing or simplification. Task 13 delivery: baked albedos are Lanczos-downsampled to at most 1024 px except the unchanged-resolution factory-floor repeat tile; previews are 512 square. PNG encoding uses RGB8 or reviewed 256-colour Floyd-Steinberg palettes; source artwork pixels and source.blend are retained. Shared PNG paths resolve from this prop folder.",
  "build_blender_version": "5.2.0 LTS",
  "geometry_only": true,
  "clip_on_behaviour_modelled": false
}
